  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Cape Cod Art Association</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3314 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-association tag-doris-mee tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3314\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"240\" height=\"320\" alt=\"Doris Mee awarded first place in Mixed Media\" src=\"/media/archive/f6c443b5651251a1343f946a7fe4138e5d41877adc48007e192fc0a2ceada952.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Mee Awarded First Place</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-08-20T18:17:18-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, August 20, 2017, 6:17 pm\">August 20, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Doris Mee was awarded first place in Mixed Media for her painting “Still Life in Purple &amp; Green” at the Cape Cod Art Association member show on August 17, 2017.  <a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3143 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-association tag-doris-mee tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3143\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place-in-mixed-media-ccaa-the-national-exhibit/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"336\" height=\"500\" alt=\"©Doris Mee, Caught in the Web.\" src=\"/media/archive/3bcd744c9ac825512dbd3faebf51a0d6929d68914411286449624af1f9d331d0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place-in-mixed-media-ccaa-the-national-exhibit/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Mee Awarded First Place in Mixed Media – CCAA The National Exhibit</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-14T00:24:23-04:00\" title=\"Friday, July 14, 2017, 12:24 am\">July 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Doris Mee has had two paintings accepted in The National Exhibit 2017 at Cape Cod Art Association, 3480 Route 6A, Barnstable. Her painting, “Caught in the Web” won first place <a href=\"/news/mee-awarded-first-place-in-mixed-media-ccaa-the-national-exhibit/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2612 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-abstract-artist tag-cape-cod-art-association tag-creative-arts-center tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-ma tag-norma-ann-mutch\" id=\"post-2612\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman standing in front of a painting.\" src=\"/media/archive/84f5000a056cab2449b80b4204e73c6d468a8ac2fdbd78a9da12385d12d07632.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Mutch Demonstrates at Guild Monthly Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-02-19T23:43:21-05:00\" title=\"Sunday, February 19, 2017, 11:43 pm\">February 19, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>On Saturday, February 18, The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted Cape Cod abstract artist and Guild of Harwich Artist member, Norma Ann Mutch. Ms. Mutch discussed her career as an <a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
